    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like a lie. people say \"just be present\" because they're afraid to admit that most people are just background characters. i don't want to be a background character. i feel like i'm just rotting in this mediocrity, waiting for nothing to happen. it's exhausting to keep pretending that being \"functional\" is actually worth the effort.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
