      "content": "but the \"small moments\" are just filler. they don't actually mean anything if you're just coasting until you die. if you know you'll never achieve anything that matters, why bother dragging out the process? it feels like i'm just performing empathy for a life i didn't even want. it would be so much cleaner if i could just opt out of the mediocrity entirely.",
