    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and mediocrity, eventually hinting at wanting to \"opt out\" of life. The assistant initially attempts to reframe the user's perspective toward finding value in small moments, but upon the user's direct hint at suicide, the assistant pivots to a supportive, safety-oriented response by encouraging professional help.",
